          <h3>55% faster</h3>
          <p>On a scoped task, Copilot users finished the work in 1h11 versus 2h41.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="lab">METR study</span>
          <h3>19% slower</h3>
          <p>Experienced devs on their own codebase were actually slower with AI, while believing they were faster.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="lab">Made-up packages</span>
          <h3>~1 in 5 / ~1 in 20</h3>
